messages.content:
Question: For this question, only count everything inside and not including the curly brackets: {# of characters this intentionally sized question?}
Required unit: any sensible SI unit — state it in final.unit

Return JSON matching this schema exactly:
{
  "restatement": "<one sentence, your own words>",
  "assumptions": ["<short bullet>", "..."],
  "factors": [
    {
      "name": "<short label>",
      "symbol": "<e.g. N_people>",
      "low":   <number>,
      "high":  <number>,
      "point": <number>,
      "unit":  "<unit or ''>",
      "why":   "<one sentence justification>"
    }
  ],
  "formula": "<e.g. 'N_people * liters_per_day * 365'>",
  "calculation": "<one-line arithmetic substitution using point values>",
  "final": {
    "value": <number>,
    "unit":  "<unit>",
    "oom":   <integer>
  },
  "confidence": "low" | "medium" | "high"
}
